  "fullText": "An adept at manipulating the latent energy within a celestial body, you harness the power of raised terrain, launching solid walls of earth, stone, or other material you've manipulated toward your foes with violent force. You make a single Omni Attack Roll against the AC of all targets in Range. Each target whose AC you meet or exceed suffers 2d4+10 Bludgeoning Damage.\nAdditionally, a creature that takes damage from this Technique must make a Strength Saving Throw or be knocked Prone.\nAt Higher Ranks: For each Rank above the original that this Technique is cast, the attributes change as follows:\nRank 2 (15 Ki, Damage 5d4+22): You may exclude allies or yourself that are within Range.\nRank 3 (24 Ki, Damage 3d10+27): If you are currently maintaining the Planet's Command - Elemental Shift Technique, you may end it immediately to cause a creature that fails the Strength Saving Throw to also be Impaled for 1 Minute as they are struck by the debris from either the storm or wall. The creature may repeat this Saving Throw to end the Impaled Condition at the end of each of its turns.\nRank 4 (33 Ki, Damage 4d10+40): The Range becomes 80ft (30ft radius Sphere). Additionally, you may choose to forgo making the Attack Roll. Instead targets within Range to must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking the full damage on a failure, half on a success."
